sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin/HR
    participant View as "Web View (admin.master.leave-types.create)"
    participant C as LeaveTypeController
    participant LT as "LeaveType Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Isi form tambah tipe cuti lalu submit
    View->>C: POST /admin/master/leave-types

    C->>C: Validasi input (name, code, max_days, days_notice, dst)

    alt Data valid
        C->>LT: Simpan tipe cuti baru
        LT->>DB: INSERT INTO leave_types (...)
        DB-->>LT: ID leave type baru

        C-->>View: Redirect ke index + flash success
        View-->>Admin: Data tipe cuti baru tampil di daftar
    else Data tidak valid
        C-->>View: Redirect back + errors + old input
        View-->>Admin: Tampilkan pesan validasi gagal
    end
